<title>UK: Feb Flotta to load 5.85 mln bbls in 10 cargoes.</title>
<headline>Feb Flotta to load 5.85 mln bbls in 10 cargoes.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>February's UK North Sea Flotta programme will consist of 10 cargoes totalling 5.85 million barrels, traders said on Friday.</p>
<p>January's Flotta programme was for 6.4 million barrels in 12 cargoes.  </p>
<p>he traders said February's programme is made up of three 500,000 barrel cargoes, four of 600,000 barrels and three of 650,000 barrels.</p>
<p>--Richard Mably, London newsroom +44 17 542 8060</p>
